    "title": "Fallen WWII soldier coming home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mary Koester ,\n1 days ago After more than 80 years, a World War II war hero will finally be making his journey home to Prairie du Rocher. And the local community is invited to honor his homecoming. Edgar William Nevois, known as Billy to family and friends, was born on April 10, 1923 to Edgar and Augusta (Blow) Nevois in Prairie du Rocher. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
